  procedure: 'Predict the caller and procedure outputs for the selected quantity. Step into ShowBooking, identify the copied Quantity parameter and follow the return to the statement immediately after CALL.',
  reference: 'Predict the final caller Total for BYREF, then switch the accumulator to BYVAL and predict again. With Total 5 and Seats 3, identify the same addition and explain why only one mode changes caller storage.',
